<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 9.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 9.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on September 7.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				 Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		    Yield     Close</p>
<p>1  Kalamazoo Hlds	  19.74     2.33</p>
<p>2  Central Norseman	13.33     0.90</p>
<p>3  Telecasters Nqld	12.96     5.40</p>
<p>4  Pac Mutual Aust	 12.45     2.41</p>
<p>5  Kurts (P) Prop	  10.34     1.45</p>
<p>6  Indu Property	   10.34     0.88</p>
<p>7  Prime Credit Tr	 10.32     0.95</p>
<p>8  Prop Income Inv	 10.31     0.99</p>
<p>9  BT Prop Trust	    9.89     1.65</p>
<p>10 Gem Property Tr	  9.73     1.44</p>
<p>11 Colonial Mutual	  9.71     1.09</p>
<p>12 Multistack		 9.68     0.31</p>
<p>13 Villa World		9.62     1.04</p>
<p>14 Blackmores Lab	   9.41     3.40</p>
<p>15 Gandel Retail Tr	 9.40     0.83</p>
<p>16 Centro Prop		8.99     2.17</p>
